[38;5;115m● [1m[39mFinalization emission[0m

The fix has two parts:

[38;5;115m•[39m [1mLive region[0m — streaming stays pre-wrapped and erasable; nothing commits while in flight.
[38;5;115m•[39m [1mCommit[0m — finished logical lines go to scrollback via [38;5;216mtea.Println[39m, unwrapped, autowrap on.

The terminal soft-wraps committed lines itself, so native selection-copy re-joins them and resize re
flows history. Each committed line ends with [38;5;216mCSI K[39m to clear stale row tails left by the live region.

